{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:54:16+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:54:16+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"AT & S Austria Technologie & Systemtechnik Aktiengesellschaft","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"Austria","city":"Leoben","website":"https://ats.net","employees":14569,"summary":"AT & S Austria Technologie & Systemtechnik Aktiengesellschaft, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures, distributes, and sells printed circuit boards in Austria, Germany, rest of Europe, China, rest of Asia, and the Americas. The company operates through Electronics Solutions, Microelectronics, and Others segments. It offers integrated circuit substrates; printed circuit boards and modules; flexible and rigid-flex, thermally enhanced, high-density interconnect, substrate like, cavity, multilayer, and double-sided printed circuit boards; and test and reference boards. The company also provides Z-Interconnect, ECP, 2.5D, advanced and power packaging, radio frequency electronics, system in package, and mSAP technological solutions. In addition, it offers design, simulation, and turnkey solutions. The company distributes its products directly to original equipment and contract electronic manufacturers. It serves semiconductors and modules; communications and 5G; consumer electronics; medical; industrial; aerospace and aviation; and automotive sectors. AT & S Austria Technologie & Systemtechnik Aktiengesellschaft was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Leoben, Austria.","exchange":"Vienna","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"AT & S Austria Technologie & Systemtechnik Aktiengesellschaft, avec ses filiales, fabrique, distribue et vend des circuits imprimés en Autriche, en Allemagne, dans le reste de l'Europe, en Chine, dans le reste de l'Asie et dans les Amériques. La société opère à travers les segments 